{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q80311","formula":"C₃₄H₄₅N₃O","hill":"C34H45N3O","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":34.0,"H":45.0,"N":3.0,"O":1.0},"names":{"en":"SB 699551"},"descriptions":{"en":"SB-699551 is a drug which was the first compound developed to act as a selective antagonist for the serotonin receptor 5-HT5A, with selectivity of around 100x over other serotonin receptor subtypes. Multiple therapeutic roles have been suggested for 5-HT5A ligands due to the presence of this receptor in several areas of the brain, but research is still at an early stage, In animal studies, SB-699551 was found to block cue-mediated responding to LSD, again suggesting an antipsychotic type of activity. It also reduces the viability of certain types of cancer cells in vitro, suggesting the 5-HT5A receptor as a possible target for novel chemotherapy drugs."},"fame":4,"pubchemCid":11168182,"mass":511.7,"charge":0,"smiles":"CN(C)CCN(CC1=CC=C(C=C1)C2=CC=C(C=C2)CNCCC3=CC=CC=C3)C(=O)CCC4CCCC4","inchikey":"SEQAMPXQRKYYQF-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"3-cyclopentyl-N-[2-(dimethylamino)ethyl]-N-[[4-[4-[(2-phenylethylamino)methyl]phenyl]phenyl]methyl]propanamide","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"11168182","atoms":83,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":6.126,"y":-0.787,"z":2.142,"el":"O"},{"x":4.837,"y":-1.156,"z":0.25,"el":"N"},{"x":4.556,"y":-4.815,"z":0.953,"el":"N"},{"x":-6.191,"y":0.315,"z":-0.086,"el":"N"},{"x":7.811,"y":2.84,"z":0.658,"el":"C"},{"x":8.778,"y":3.613,"z":1.549,"el":"C"},{"x":8.645,"y":2.6,"z":-0.596,"el":"C"},{"x":9.493,"y":4.559,"z":0.588,"el":"C"},{"x":9.397,"y":3.912,"z":-0.795,"el":"C"},{"x":7.304,"y":1.558,"z":1.295,"el":"C"},{"x":6.307,"y":0.838,"z":0.389,"el":"C"},{"x":5.758,"y":-0.436,"z":1.018,"el":"C"},{"x":4.272,"y":-2.392,"z":0.778,"el":"C